{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CfXqLpVMcwkXHAYi5M5re","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"VERDICT: LGTM\n\nThe change decomposes the idempotency feature cleanly along the grain of this codebase's OfficeFloor function style:\n\n- **Responsibilities land in the right units.** `CheckIdempotencyKey` is a natural entry gate (read header → consult store → branch), `RecordIdempotencyKey` is a focused post-save step, and `IdempotencyStore` isolates the persistence concern as a Spring `@Component`. No class is turning into a catch-all — each has one cohesive job and a single public method, per AGENTS.md.\n- **Idiomatic wiring.** Branching is done with `@Flow`/`outputs:` and a `ContinueFlow` functional interface (correctly shared across both branches, since the taken branch is named by the annotation value), matching the documented pattern. The new steps carry `govern: [ transaction ]` consistently with the rest of the pipeline.\n- **Good reuse, minimal surface.** The `existing` branch reuses the existing `RespondWithOwner` (200) rather than introducing a redundant responder, and the feature is purely additive — the normal create path is untouched when no header is present.\n- **Naming follows the convention.** `Check…`/`Record…` are verb-plus-noun, and DTO/entity boundaries are respected (`@Val Owner`, no new DTOs leaking inward).\n- **Intent is well-documented**, including the deliberate choice to keep the store outside domain persistence.\n\nMinor, non-blocking observations (not worth a change on their own): the `idempotencyKey != null && !idempotencyKey.isBlank()` guard is duplicated in the two function classes, but extracting a shared helper would arguably be *less* idiomatic in a style where steps deliberately don't call each other; and `IdempotencyStore` is named generically while living in the `owner` package and storing owner ids — acceptable since it's only used here. Neither undermines the structure."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11720,"cache_read_input_tokens":11787,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11720},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89823354-9f9d-4359-85d4-4ffe0a1247f5","uuid":"415d6045-6682-4148-982f-e9c2be02a227","timestamp":"2026-09-29T13:47:52.770Z","request_id":"req_011CfXqLp2qHVTnff9TKyrcA"}
